{"lang":"hi","dir":"ltr","title":"C&#39;s Cuts | फ़ेयरफ़ील्ड, CA में बार्बरशॉप: फ़ेड, टेपर और लाइन-अप","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">मुख्य सामग्री पर जाएँ</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C&#39;s</span><span>C&#39;s Cuts</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">हमारे बारे में</a><a href=\"#services\">सेवाएँ</a><a href=\"#faq\">सवाल-जवाब</a><a href=\"#gallery\">तस्वीरें</a><a href=\"#reviews\">रिव्यू</a><a href=\"#visit\">समय और पता</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"भाषा\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\" selected>हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\">कॉल करें</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/storefront.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">बार्बरशॉप · फ़ेयरफ़ील्ड, CA · 2010 से</p>\n    <h1>C&#39;s Cuts</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">साफ़ फ़ेड, तीखे लाइन-अप, और बार्बर जो जल्दबाज़ी नहीं करते। 2010 से फ़ेयरफ़ील्ड की मोहल्ले वाली दुकान।</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · Google पर 135 रिव्यू<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> बारी के लिए कॉल करें</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=C&#39;s%20Cuts%2C%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%2C%20Fairfield%2C%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> रास्ता</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>2010 से</li><li>बिना अपॉइंटमेंट आएँ</li><li>कैश या Zelle</li><li>बच्चों की कटिंग</li><li>निजी पार्किंग लॉट</li><li>व्हीलचेयर के लिए सुलभ</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">हमारी दुकान</p><h2>कोई जल्दबाज़ी नहीं। बस एक शानदार कटिंग।</h2><p>C&#39;s Cuts (जिसे C&#39;s Barber Shop भी कहते हैं) 2010 से North Texas Street पर बाल काट रही है। हमारी ख़ासियतें हैं नई कटिंग, टेपर, फ़ेड, क्रू कट, ट्रिम और उस्तरे से लाइन-अप।</p><p>Chris, Christine और हमारी बाकी टीम आराम से काम करती है, हर बारीकी पर ध्यान देती है और बात करने में आसान है। बहुत से माता-पिता अपने बच्चों को भी लाते हैं।</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>135 रिव्यू</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>बिना अपॉइंटमेंट</b><span>स्वागत है</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2010</b><span>स्थापना</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"C&#39;s Cuts में नया फ़ेड\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">कुर्सी पर</p><h2>कटिंग और सेवाएँ</h2><p>हमारी ख़ासियतें। कुछ अलग चाहिए तो अपने बार्बर को बताइए।</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>नई कटिंग</h3></div><p>आपकी रोज़ की कटिंग, साफ़ करके आपकी पसंद के मुताबिक़ शेप की हुई।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>फ़ेड</h3></div><p>लो, मिड, हाई और बाल्ड फ़ेड, साफ़ ब्लेंड किए हुए।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>टेपर</h3></div><p>गर्दन और कनपटियों पर साफ़ टेपर।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>क्रू कट</h3></div><p>छोटा, क्लासिक और संभालने में आसान।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>ट्रिम</h3></div><p>लंबाई वही रखें और सब कुछ साफ़-सुथरा करवाएँ।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>उस्तरे से लाइन-अप</h3></div><p>सीधे उस्तरे से तीखे किनारे।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>बच्चों की कटिंग</h3></div><p>छोटे बच्चों (और नख़रेबाज़ माता-पिता) के लिए धैर्य वाले बार्बर।</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">दाम ऑनलाइन नहीं डाले गए हैं। मौजूदा दामों के लिए (707) 673-7601 पर कॉल करें। भुगतान: सिर्फ़ कैश या Zelle।</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">जानने लायक</p><h2>आने से पहले</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>बिना अपॉइंटमेंट आएँ</b></li><li><b>कैश या Zelle</b><span>क्रेडिट कार्ड नहीं</span></li><li><b>निजी पार्किंग लॉट</b><span>सड़क से हटकर, रोशनी वाला लॉट, आगे और पीछे दरवाज़े</span></li><li><b>साइकिल पार्किंग</b></li><li><b>व्हीलचेयर के लिए सुलभ</b></li><li><b>बच्चों की कटिंग</b><span>बहुत से माता-पिता बच्चों को लाते हैं</span></li><li><b>2010 में स्थापित</b></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">गैलरी</p><h2>दुकान से</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"तीखे लाइन-अप के साथ स्किन फ़ेड\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/textured-cut.jpg\" alt=\"ऊपर लंबे टेक्सचर वाले बालों के साथ फ़ेड\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"2240 N Texas St पर C&#39;s Cuts का सामने का हिस्सा\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront-2.jpg\" alt=\"बार्बर पोल के साथ C&#39;s Cuts का दरवाज़ा\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">रिव्यू</p><h2>फ़ेयरफ़ील्ड की पसंदीदा कुर्सी</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 135 रिव्यू</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google पर और रिव्यू पढ़ें →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 34 रिव्यू</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp पर और रिव्यू पढ़ें →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Woke up this morning took a quick glance in the mirror; and thought to myself &quot;Dam C!!!! you did a great job on the haircut....Thnx Bro!!&quot; Cya on the nxt1”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best haircut I’ve had in my two years in Cali and I’ll definitely be here every month. I recommend this shop to anyone who wants a legit cut for a legit price (don’t forget to tip). They make sure you’re not looking in the mirror afterwards wondering why you still go to them.”</blockquote><figcaption>— T&#39;Arris B. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Found my new go to barber in Fairfield. Chris and Christine are cool people, and all the barbers know what they’re doing. My first time I got a fresh fade from Christine. They take their time to give you the best cut for your money. Definitely recommend checking them out. Support your local Filipino shop!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Thomas A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Just got a cut from Chris and it was honestly one of the best I’ve had. He took his time, paid attention to every detail, and the fade came out super clean. The top was shaped perfectly, and you can tell he genuinely cares about his clients. He’s down to earth, easy to talk to, and really takes pride in what he does. If you’re looking for someone who doesn’t rush and delivers high-quality work, Chris is the one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C’s Barbershop is great. I get my haircut by Chris. He’s a stand up guy — a great barber and friend. Always offers good conversation and takes pride in his craft. I always leave the shop feeling good about myself. My friend also gets his haircut by Chris’ wife, and she is talented as well. Affordable prices and great company has me coming back as a regular!”</blockquote><figcaption>— James R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C&#39;s cuts has been my go-to place for almost 15 years for my hair cut needs. The environment is always great, and well-rounded barbers with steady hands are always hard to find, especially ones for such a great price. I truly recommend everybody to get their cuts, line ups, and fades at C&#39;s. You won&#39;t regret how great you look and feel afterward”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Chris and Christine takes their time to cut my hair. They are both very skilled barbers. Highly recommended if you want a nice clean and sharp looking haircut. Hint: go to either Chris and Christine first for your first time haircut.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alexander C. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I’ve been coming to this place for a couple years now, and they’ve always been really kind and understanding. Before finding this place I had a really rough time finding someone who could cut my hair the way I like it, and by my surprise I found it down the street from me. 100/100 I’d recommend this place, and if you’re into a more chilled out vibe this is the place.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have two young boys and I can be very picky on who cuts their hair. I tend to have the usual people cut their hair but unfortunately none of them were available. I decided to go where my nephew always goes, C’s Barbershop. Let me just say that I’m very impressed !! Shoutout to the talented female who cut their hair! I wish I knew her name! I will definitely be bringing them back to her :)”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jeanette A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">सवाल-जवाब</p><h2>आपके सवालों के जवाब</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>क्या मुझे अपॉइंटमेंट चाहिए?</summary><p>नहीं, सीधे आ जाइए। अगर आप अपॉइंटमेंट लेना चाहते हैं या इंतज़ार का पता करना है, तो हमें (707) 673-7601 पर कॉल करें।</p></details><details><summary>क्या आप क्रेडिट कार्ड लेते हैं?</summary><p>हम क्रेडिट कार्ड नहीं लेते। हम कैश या Zelle लेते हैं।</p></details><details><summary>खुलने का समय क्या है?</summary><p>हम सोमवार से शनिवार, सुबह 10 से शाम 5 बजे तक खुले रहते हैं, रविवार बंद। समय बदल सकता है, इसलिए पहले कॉल कर लें।</p></details><details><summary>मैं गाड़ी कहाँ पार्क करूँ?</summary><p>हमारे पास निजी पार्किंग लॉट और दो दरवाज़े हैं, एक आगे और एक पीछे।</p></details><details><summary>क्या आप बच्चों के बाल काटते हैं?</summary><p>जी हाँ! बहुत से माता-पिता अपने बेटों को लाते हैं।</p></details><details><summary>दुकान कब से खुली है?</summary><p>हम 2010 से खुले हैं।</p></details><details><summary>क्या दुकान व्हीलचेयर के लिए सुलभ है?</summary><p>हाँ, हम व्हीलचेयर के लिए सुलभ हैं।</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">हमसे मिलें</p>\n      <h2>समय और पता</h2>\n      <address>2240 N Texas St<br>Fairfield, CA 94533</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\">(707) 673-7601</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>सोमवार</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>मंगलवार</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>बुधवार</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>गुरुवार</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>शुक्रवार</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>शनिवार</td><td>10 AM – 5 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>रविवार</td><td>बंद</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">समय बदल सकता है, इसलिए पक्का करने के लिए कॉल कर लें।</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> कॉल करें</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=C&#39;s%20Cuts%2C%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%2C%20Fairfield%2C%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> रास्ता देखें</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"map\">\n      <iframe title=\"C&#39;s Cuts तक का नक्शा\" src=\"https://www.google.co